# Learn Command

Defines behavior for the /learn command that creates learning documents with technical translations and non-developer explanations.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- User invokes `/learn <topic> [url] [relate]` command
- Need to create learning documents
- Researching new topics
- Documenting knowledge for future reference

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable documentation patterns.

